      "content": "maybe \"moving forward\" is just another way of saying \"struggling pointlessly.\" i look at the horizon and i don't see a future, i just see more of the same emptiness. does it ever feel like maybe the most peaceful thing would be to just stop fighting the current and let the drift take you? to finally just let go and stop being a burden to a world i don't even belong to?",
